Sung uses Google Material Symbols, licensed under Apache-2.0.
The license is provided in licenses/MaterialSymbols-LICENSE.txt.
Icons originate from https://github.com/google/material-design-icons.
Icons use the official Material Symbols Rounded, FILL=1, 24px SVG assets.
Spun application code is not incorporated into Sung.

Visual references: Google Material Design 3 and Spun.
Architecture reference: https://github.com/amiralibg/unstream.
No Unstream source code is incorporated.

Runtime dependencies carry their own licenses. Qt is dynamically linked;
Qt licensing: https://www.qt.io/licensing/open-source-lgpl-obligations
The installed Qt Multimedia and FFmpeg packages determine the media backend.
Catalog requests use ytmusicapi (MIT); audio resolution uses yt-dlp (Unlicense).
No fonts are bundled. Sung uses an installed Google Sans Flex or Noto Sans font.
Sung is independent of Google and YouTube.
